                <div class="postingContent">
		
                    <ul>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        

                        
                        
                    </ul>
                
	</div>
                <div class="postingContent">
                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">A Statement of Qualifications (SOQ) is required to apply for this position. You must provide narrative responses and specific examples for each item listed below in your SOQ to be considered for this position. Your SOQ must be typed in 12-point font, no longer than 3 pages, organized and numbered as reflected below, and must respond to all the following items. Resumes, letters, and other materials will not be considered in the place of the SOQ.<br /> </span></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Describe how your interpersonal skills enable you to effectively collaborate with a wide range of individuals, including management, executives, employees, stakeholders, elected officials and other public agency representatives.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Describe your training, education, and experience as each relates to your ability to administer and oversee the safety and security program of a large-scale transportation infrastructure project.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">   Provide specific examples of how you have achieved positive results in either implementing an occupational safety and health field construction safety program, coordinating an occupational safety and health safety and security training program, or developing a robust safety and security policy and procedure plan.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Describe your experience using leading and lagging safety-related indicators to improve program-level safety for railways or similar transportation systems.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Crisis management is a critical aspect of construction safety and security. Please share an example of a crisis situation you have managed in the past and how you effectively handled it.</span></li></ol></div><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Applications
received without the SOQ will not be considered. For assistance in completing
the SOQ, please reach out to the Human Resources Contact below.</span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">

</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /> </span></span>
                </div>
            
</div>

